  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 402.03 Sanctions. Upon an affirmative finding that a licensee has committed professional misconduct, the board shall take disciplinary action as specified by RSA 310:12, I-a.\n\nSource. #14537, eff 4-24-26",
